  "details": "This has happened twice so far--cannot get a perfect repro, but here's the behavior:\nAFK icon is on, even when otherwise fully in game with Steam menu closed.  Tracking works, but locomotion is blocked.\n- Using SteamVR and XS Overlay, FPS VR\n- AFK detection enabled\nFirst instance: hit mute, hit Steam menu, then took off all hardware.  Came back after enough time for controllers to have turned off.  Stuck in AFK mode (icon on).  Eventually turned controllers off and on a few times and recovered.\nSecond instance: Had loaded in to the game normally, and calibration was shifted to the side, so tried turning controllers off and on, recalibrating a number of times, and then was stuck in AFK mode.  No amount of restarting controllers worked, had to relaunch game.  AFK icon on, no Steam menu, unable to locomote.",
